ok - fm_backend_paseo_version_check: accepts the verified minimum (0.8.0)
ok - fm_backend_paseo_version_check: accepts a newer version (0.9.2)
ok - fm_backend_paseo_version_check: refuses an old version loudly
ok - fm_backend_paseo_version_check: refuses loudly when paseo is not found on PATH or at the bundle path
