ok - fm_backend_paseo_create_task: creates the shared workspace once plus a terminal tab and parses terminal_id/workspace_id
ok - fm_backend_paseo_create_task: refuses, creating nothing, when the terminal or workspace inventory cannot be read
ok - fm_backend_paseo_create_task: adopts the project's live firstmate workspace by cwd+label and adds a tab (never a second workspace)
