ok - fm_backend_paseo_capture: fetches the whole scrollback and trims to N lines locally
ok - fm_backend_paseo_capture: fails when the target terminal is absent
ok - fm_backend_paseo_send_key: passes the key through unchanged to the recorded terminal id
